.SS "\fBHash32\fP SystemEx\&.Hash\&.BernsteinHash\&.Compute (FixedVector< byte > input, uint seed)"

.PP
Computes a simple 32‑bit hash from the given byte sequence\&. The hash starts with the provided \fIseed\fP  and mixes each byte using a small multiplier (31), similar to traditional Bernstein/DJB hash variants\&.

.PP
\fBEndian\fP does not affect this algorithm directly; it is included for interface compatibility with other \fBSystemEx\fP hashers\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIinput\fP The input data to hash\&.
.br
\fIseed\fP The seed value for the hash computation\&.
.RE
.PP
